{"id":"c29191ea1d4ce7b7","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-coce-separation.md","title":"不交 co-c.e. 集合可计算分离","display":"thm-coce-separation — 不交 co-c.e. 集合可计算分离","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-coce-separation","aliases":["20-thm-coce-separation"],"display":"thm-coce-separation — 不交 co-c.e. 集合可计算分离","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.1.22","source_printed_pages":[27,28],"source_pdf_pages":[63,64],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-reduction-principle]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]","[[20-df-separator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-coce-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-coce-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-coce-separation — 不交 co-c.e. 集合可计算分离"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.1.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span><span>28</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73933abd41be8c66\" href=\"?note=73933abd41be8c66\" title=\"20-thm-reduction-principle\">20-thm-reduction-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap B=\\varnothing\">\\(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A,\\overline B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(\\overline A,\\overline B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73933abd41be8c66\" href=\"?note=73933abd41be8c66\" title=\"20-thm-reduction-principle\">20-thm-reduction-principle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}coce\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\operatorname{Separates}(C;A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}coce\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\operatorname{Separates}(C;A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 Ā、B̄ 用 reduction principle 得不交 c.e. U⊆Ā、V⊆B̄ 且 U∪V=ω。因 A 中的点不能在 U，它们全在 V；又 V∩B=∅。U 是 V 的 c.e. 补集，所以 V 可计算，取 C=V。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.1.22；印刷页 27, 28；PDF 第 63, 64 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-reduction-principle","status":"resolved","id":"73933abd41be8c66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-reduction-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rec-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-separator]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-reduction-principle","status":"resolved","id":"73933abd41be8c66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-reduction-principle]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-separator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-reduction-principle]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-separator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-reduction-principle]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-df-separator]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap B=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A,\\overline B\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}coce\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\in\\mathcal R\\ \\operatorname{Separates}(C;A,B).","display":true}],"bytes":1251,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-coce-separation]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-coce-separation]]"}],"outgoing":["73933abd41be8c66","550ce05cba351a42","9f5c300501e65ad4"]}